# Approved matches for scripts/scan-personal-data.py. Keep this file small.
# Tab-separated: path, pattern, most matches allowed per file version (or *), reason.
# Never put the matched value here. The paths metadata:commit-author and
# metadata:commit-message mean commit metadata.
metadata:commit-author	identity-name	*	the owner's name as commit author
scripts/build-release.sh	identity-name	1	the public repository URL required in release source notices
README.md	identity-name	1	the public project clone URL or Pages installation URL
scripts/install.sh	identity-name	1	the public repository release URL
docs/install	identity-name	1	the public repository release URL in the pinned Pages launcher
scripts/live-install-smoke.py	identity-name	2	the public Pages install URL and repository clone URL for clean-VM acceptance
docs/install.md	identity-name	1	the public repository release URL
.audit/build.tsv	identity-name	5	public repository and merged pull request URLs in the build log
crates/hx-interpret/src/snapshots/hx_interpret__digest__tests__mac_only_digest_main.snap	captured-prose	2	fixed renderer format and citation instructions; sample observations and screen text are synthetic
docs/BUILD-BRIEF.md	identity-name	1	the public repository URL
docs/setup.md	identity-name	1	the public repository clone URL in the source-build guide
scripts/readme-commands.test.py	identity-name	1	the public Pages installation URL asserted by the README contract
docs/maintainers/validation.md	identity-name	5	public project workflow, Pages install and release URLs in the acceptance evidence
CHANGELOG.md	identity-name	1	the public GitLab project URL in the hosting move entry
SECURITY.md	identity-name	1	the public GitLab issue URL for confidential reports
docs/maintainers/decisions.md	identity-name	1	the public GitLab project URL in the hosting decision
docs/releases.md	identity-name	1	the public GitLab project URL in the hosting note
scripts/pages-site.sh	identity-name	3	the public GitLab project URL on the Pages landing page
